      <ol>
        <li><b>🛞 Travel by chariot</b> through 12 stops — one Bible story for each of the Ten Commandments, plus a story of forgiveness and a story of giving.</li>
        <li><b>📖 Read the story</b>, then face a <b>life choice</b> from today's world that tests the same commandment.</li>
        <li><b>⚖️ Choose.</b> Faithful choices earn a <b>👑 crown</b>, raise your <b>❤️ virtue</b> and <b>✝️ faith</b>, and earn <b>🪙 talents</b>.</li>
